window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Travelling on the luxury train service to Vienzza, The Dominie and Alice discover that one of their fellow passengers is a killer: but which one? As time runs out and the body count begins to rise, the Time Travellers realise that things may not be all they seem.</p> <p>Written and Directed by Nigel Fairs. Post-Production and Music by Graheme Wilson. Produced by Bill Baggs. Sylvester McCoy (The Dominie), Sophie Aldred (Alice), Jackie Skarvellis (Betty Durham), Bernard Kay (Sid Durham), Keith Drinkel (Baloney), Andrew Laycock (Leach), John Cormack (Zagess), Jo Castleton (Djala).</p>"; 
